id: pursuit-of-perfection
name: Pursuit of Perfection
order: 4
optionOf: artificial-warrior
description: >
  Gain access to the Absorb Special Maneuver and increase your maximum number of Adaptation Points by 1.
text: >
  Pursuit of Perfection [Passive]: Gain access to the Absorb Special Maneuver and increase your maximum number of Adaptation Points by 1.
  Pursuit of Perfection [Addendum]: Please refer to the ‘Absorbed Perfection’ text box below.

---

[passive]
# (4)
allow maneuver.absorb;
adaptation.max += 1;
# (5) Its Addendum, Absorbed Perfection, on the Trait's Options tab - the Perfection Target the ARC's, the Absorption and Perfection
# Awakenings not built yet.
